  "modification_guides": [
    {
      "question": "注册逻辑与布局分别在哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "首页OnMessage(2)在IsTWServer()真时打开外部REGISTER_URL（按g_LangVersion分支）；仅非TW才隐藏首页并register.Show(True)->Step(0)。register各CRegPanel与回调负责逻辑，布局reg1/reg2/reg3/reg4/reg5.dlg，CConfirm另用login/confirm.dlg。confirm是独立确认入口，不能当成Step序列；未验证布局资源内容或注册服务可用。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "mp_entry",
          "confirm",
          "reg1",
          "reg2",
          "reg2_2980",
          "panels34",
          "stepshow"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "注册点击后经过哪些函数？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "普通注册：CRegPanel1.OnMessage(1)->Step(1)->CRegPanel2；DoNext校验并请求；OnReceiveProcess分派；OnRegisterGame错误120显示验证码，成功Step(2)->CRegPanel4。2980为Register2980与OnRegister分支，成功构造CRegPanel3_2980，不是同一Step(2)链。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "reg1",
          "reg2",
          "reg2_2980",
          "callbacks",
          "stepshow"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "验证码失败在哪里处理？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "OnRegisterGame错误120要求验证码并ShowRegisterCheckCode；OnRegCode解析失败/err非零调用ShowRegisterCodeFail，成功ShowRegisterCheckCode；CCheckCodeBox.RequestNewCode负责请求刷新。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "checkcode",
          "callbacks",
          "stepshow"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
